                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "So... it took me about 8 hours to fully complete a run (yes, ONE run. You can save, fortunately !)\nIt's very similar to The Legend of Zelda, but you start over once you've beaten the baddie.\n\nThis game isn't a roguelite nor a roguelike, in my opinion. It's... its own thing.\nNo unlocks as far as I know (aside from different starting loadouts). You basically play The Legend of Zelda but with a different hero once you've defeated the end boss.\nThe gameplay's good, the art is great, the music's nice.\nBasically, a good all around game that you can sink a few dozen hours in. Not much else to say.\nRecommended. :)",
